# Feature modules

Layout per feature under `src/modules/<feature>/`:

| File | Role |
| --- | --- |
| `index.ts` | Routes: prefix, tags, `.use(authPlugin|i18nPlugin|sharedModels)`, wire to service |
| `model.ts` | Elysia `t` schemas; wrap payloads with `successSchema` / `paginatedDataSchema` |
| `service.ts` | Business logic, ACL/ownership, return `ok` / `okList` / throw via `failT` |
| `repository.ts` | Optional Drizzle access for this domain only |

```ts
// ✅ GOOD — register in app.ts, tests in tests/modules/<feature>/
export const notes = new Elysia({ prefix: "/api/notes" })
  .use(authPlugin)
  .get("/", ({ user, locale }) => NoteService.list(user, locale), { auth: true })

// ❌ BAD — domain queries in src/db/repository or a mega "files" module for storage
```

- Use macros: `auth: true`, `permission: { resource: ["action"] }`.
- Shared helpers → `src/lib/`; feature-only helpers → same module folder.
- Response strings in models: `trusted: true` so sanitize does not double-escape JSON.
